// (style podskazka2, seed 1): a drop → the wishing room → echo flowers → quiet water → rain → memory → umbrella.
// Themes: A — Echo Flowers (эхо-цветы) (recomposed), B — Quiet Water (тихая вода) (as written); the bridge melody is newly
// composed on the rhythm of a theme from шаблон. Computed parts: a counter-melody from the chords, the theme at half speed in the outro, a key change up.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
// x is time in beats; n counts semitones from C4 (MIDI 60).
